$$f\left( x \right) = \left\{ {\matrix{
{{{\left( {{4 \over 5}} \right)}^{{{\tan \,4x} \over {\tan \,5x}}}}\,\,,} & {0 < x < {\pi \over 2}} \cr
{k + {2 \over 5}\,\,\,,} & {x = {\pi \over 2}} \cr

} } \right.$$

is continuous at x = $${\pi \over 2},$$ is :

